# Facts about Corvin Ashby.

@fact corvin.locks
tier: surface
text: Knows every locked door in the academy and owes money to at least three people.

@fact corvin.last_warning
tier: personal
hint: Court him.
unlock: seen(corvin_rooftop) > 0
text: He is on his last warning. One more detention and they send him home, and home is not a good place.

@fact corvin.brother
tier: secret
unlock: seen(corvin_brother) > 0
text: His brother turns up for money and threatens to tell the headmistress where Corvin learned to pick locks.

@fact corvin.grandfather
tier: personal
unlock: seen(corvin_confiscation_vault) > 0
text: His grandfather's lucky deck sat in the confiscation vault for decades. It really is lucky.

@fact corvin.cartographers
tier: secret
hint: Become his friend, and accept the invitation that comes at night.
unlock: member(cartographers)
text: He runs the Midnight Cartographers, the club that doesn't exist.

@fact corvin.trolls
tier: personal
hint: Lend him money when he asks.
unlock: seen(corvin_debt) > 0
text: He once owed thirty crowns to trolls and offered to pay you back with a goat.

@fact corvin.sundays
tier: personal
hint: Get his lucky deck back for him, then ask about his grandfather.
unlock: chosen(corvin_lucky_deck, left)
text: His grandfather could find a lost thing in any house, and taught him to shuffle on rainy Sundays. He's the one person Corvin talks about without a joke.

@fact corvin.master_map
tier: secret
hint: Join the Cartographers, and help fill in the blanks on their map.
unlock: flag(carto_map_chain)
text: The Cartographers' last Keeper left him the Master Map. Whoever draws two lines in its old blanks keeps it with him.

@fact corvin.lane
tier: personal
hint: Spend a break in the capital, and find Ashby Lane.
unlock: seen(ashby_the_chair) > 0
text: Everyone on Ashby Lane knows him, lends him nothing, and would hide him from the watch without being asked.

@fact corvin.sill
tier: secret
hint: Walk Ashby Lane after dark, once you are friends.
unlock: seen(ashby_coins_on_the_sill) > 0
text: He sends his mother money he doesn't have, left on her windowsill at night, so that he doesn't have to go in.
